This skill is a Minis-focused adaptation and extension layer. It was renamed from its working title and is not an official release of the upstream project.
It preserves upstream methods and bundled reference material while changing:

- runtime assumptions
- output paths
- signing path
- interaction model
- routing and clarification framework
- default target platform (iOS/iPadOS and OS 27 instead of macOS), with the macOS-only parts of the bundled data and `APPINTENTS.md` removed or trimmed

It also adds material that is not from upstream: a catalog of third-party App Intents with its lookup script, validator checks and documentation, and clarification through the `user_ask` tool. See `UPSTREAM_ATTRIBUTION.md` for the file-by-file list. Files listed there as modified no longer match the upstream copies.

